NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000242 "=head1 CONTRIBUTING"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000243 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000244 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000245 "To contribute, you can send patches by email/via RT, or send pull requests on"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000246 "GitHub."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000247 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000248 "Most of the time, you don't need to build the distribution yourself. You can"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000249 "simply modify the code, then test via:"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000250 ""
