NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000252 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000253 "If you want to build the distribution (e.g. to try to install it locally on your"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000254 "system), you can install L<Dist::Zilla>,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000255 "L<Dist::Zilla::PluginBundle::Author::PERLANCAR>,"
